WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.320
CARTER MORGAN: Hi,
I'm Carter Morgan,

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.945
and today I'm going to share how
Google Cloud AppSheet can help

00:00:03.945 --> 00:00:05.730
empower citizen
developers to build

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.740
their own no-code applications.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.832
Let's get started.

00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:11.664
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.758
Have you spent countless hours
sifting through an endless list

00:00:19.758 --> 00:00:22.050
of out-of-the-box solutions,
frustrated that nothing is

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.198
quite what you'd
hope it would be?

00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:25.740
Do you ever think
to yourself, I know

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.540
what I need to be
successful, I wish

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.580
I could just build it myself?

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.980
If so, no need to
look any further.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.010
No-code solutions like Google
Cloud AppSheet is democratizing

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:38.513
technology, allowing everyone,
everywhere-- including you--

00:00:38.513 --> 00:00:39.930
to become a citizen
developer that

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:45.070
creates custom applications
to meet your unique needs.

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:47.370
This means that by
leveraging the power of data,

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:50.190
non-technical individuals can
build their own applications

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:53.250
without even needing to know
how to write a line of code.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.310
By expanding the pool of who can
access app development from 10

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:59.412
million software engineers to
more than 2 billion people,

00:00:59.412 --> 00:01:01.620
AppSheet is helping increase
the number of people who

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.019
can provide a quick solution.

00:01:04.019 --> 00:01:05.970
With the right no-code
platform in place,

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.250
this newfound talent pool
of citizen developers

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.400
can help their companies ideate
quickly, drive innovation,

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.550
and increase agility in an
ever changing work environment.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.920
But how exactly
does AppSheet work?

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.980
Well, it engages with your data,
and through Machine Learning,

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.825
processes the
information in the data

00:01:21.825 --> 00:01:24.450
and creates application that can
be used on desktops, for those

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.430
in the office, or
on mobile devices,

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.290
for those in the field.

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:29.790
You can think about
no-code behaving

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.740
like a self-driving car.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:33.180
These self-driving
platforms allow

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.220
you to describe to them
where you want to go,

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.930
and AppSheet will
drive you there.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.880
In this case, your data
is the description.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:42.030
And certain data points, like
dates or email addresses,

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:46.350
influence how your application
looks, feels, and behaves.

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:49.230
There are three key areas of
no-code development that set

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.300
AppSheet apart in
the no-code space--

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:54.835
governance, AI &amp; ML
capabilities, and automation.

00:01:54.835 --> 00:01:57.210
For now, we're going to provide
a quick walk-through that

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:59.430
showcases how
Google AI &amp; ML help

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:02.020
you get started with AppSheet
in just a few clicks.

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.150
Let's get started.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.530
First, we're going to
authorize your data source.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:10.350
On the AppSheet home page,
click the Start for Free button.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:14.310
You'll be taken to a screen that
states Start with Your Data.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:16.480
Select your cloud-based
data source-- in this case,

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:17.880
we'll be using
our Google Drive--

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.922
and authorize your account
to work with AppSheet.

00:02:19.922 --> 00:02:23.013
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:02:23.013 --> 00:02:24.180
Your data will not be moved.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:27.370
It will remain with your
preferred data source.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.130
Once you've authorized
your data source,

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.840
you will be taken to
your account page.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:32.760
For a quick start,
click Make a New App,

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.940
and select Start
with Your Own Data.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:37.710
Next, provide a name
for your application

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:40.320
and select the type of
application you want to build.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.540
For this app, let's build
a field service inspection

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.650
application.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.540
Click Select Data, and
select from the list

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.240
of authorized data sources.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.377
Select the appropriate
file for your application,

00:02:50.377 --> 00:02:52.710
and then let Google's Machine
Learning analyze your data

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:54.990
and make smart suggestions
based on the type of data

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:57.510
and your source.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.800
In this survey app, AppSheet
made recommendations

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.800
for views of maps
and image gallery

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:05.310
and forms based on your data.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.860
From here, you can customize
how your application looks

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.983
and behaves, add
automation, and decide

00:03:09.983 --> 00:03:11.900
who you'd like to share
your application with.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.847
The emulator on the right
provides real-time updates

00:03:16.847 --> 00:03:19.180
and different screen types
to the changes you're making,

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:21.138
so you can iterate on
your application quickly.

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.770
From the complex
solutions to simple forms,

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.450
the possibilities
are endless for what

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.512
can be accomplished with a
no-code platform like AppSheet.

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:34.970
Ready to start building a custom
line of business solutions

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:36.555
that will empower your team?

00:03:36.555 --> 00:03:38.930
Get started today by clicking
the link in the description

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:39.830
below.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.700
Happy app building.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.450
